+    """Read a serving ring without mutating it and append verifier rows aside.
+
+    Attention consumes the chronological ``window-1+k`` view used by the native
+    RotatingKVCache block path. Only ``new_keys/new_values`` leave the compiled
+    graph; the transaction commits their accepted prefix to the serving ring.
+    """
